{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "The Government must review & update medical restrictions on joining the Military",
        "additional_details": "We want the Government to review current medical prohibitions. We feel that conditions like mild asthma, some food allergies and conditions that occurred at a young age should not deny entry, especially if the GP says they are able.",
        "background": "We believe the UK Government is turning away too many people from their life-long dream of serving their country due to minor faults, even from a young age. ",
